{
	"id": "2dd2b712-3687-4910-ab92-378c46125129",
	"title": "Trouver une racine évidente d'un polynôme",
	"grades": ["1_SPE"],
	"points": ["1SPE-060"],
	"theme": "Fonctions",
	"domain": "Polynôme du second degré",
	"subdomain": "Racines",
	"level": 3,
	"delay": 20,
	"status": "published",
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Trouve une racine évidente de ce polynôme :\n\n$$P(x)={{eval:x^2-(r+s)x+r*s}}$$\n\nUne racine évidente est $?$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "x|x"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1|-1|2|-2"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["s != r"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}",
					"rulesSuffice": true
				}
			],
			"validationRules": [
				{
					"type": "equation_root",
					"equation": "(x)^2-(({{r}})+({{s}}))*(x)+({{r}})*({{s}})=0",
					"variable": "x"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On cherche une racine parmi les valeurs simples $1$, $-1$, $2$, $-2$ en calculant $P(x)$.",
					"Pour $x={{r}}$ : $P({{r}}) = {{eval:r;()}}^2 {{if:r+s!=0|{{eval:-(r+s);+}} \\times {{eval:r;()}}}} {{if:s!=0|{{eval:r*s;+}}}} = {{eval:r^2}} {{if:r+s!=0|{{eval:-(r+s)*r;+}}}} {{if:s!=0|{{eval:r*s;+}}}} = 0$.",
					"Le résultat est nul : ${{r}}$ est une racine évidente de $P$ (l'autre racine est ${{s}}$)."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Trouve une racine évidente de ce polynôme :\n\n$$P(x)={{eval:ax^2+bx+c}}$$\n\nUne racine évidente est $?$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "x|x"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1|-1"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..5;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "1..7;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "eval:-(q+a*r)"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "eval:q*r"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["q != a*r"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}",
					"rulesSuffice": true
				}
			],
			"validationRules": [
				{
					"type": "equation_root",
					"equation": "({{a}})*(x)^2+({{b}})*(x)+({{c}})=0",
					"variable": "x"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On cherche une racine parmi les valeurs simples $1$ et $-1$ : $P(1)=a+b+c$ et $P(-1)=a-b+c$.",
					"Pour $x={{r}}$ : $P({{r}}) = {{a}} \\times {{eval:r;()}}^2 {{if:b!=0|{{eval:b;+}} \\times {{eval:r;()}}}} {{eval:c;+}} = {{a}} {{if:b!=0|{{eval:b*r;+}}}} {{eval:c;+}} = 0$.",
					"Le résultat est nul : ${{r}}$ est une racine évidente de $P$ (l'autre racine est ${{eval:q/a}}$)."
				]
			}
		}
	],
